<section xml:id="sec_what_are_waves" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Wave Motion</title>


	<subsubsection>
<title>Warm-up Activity</title>
</subsubsection>

<activity xml:id="x_intro-waves">
<title>Explore What You Know</title>
<statement>
	<p>
		
	</p>
<p>You have probably already encountered waves in your everyday life.  Start by writing down a short list of things you already know about or waves from your personal experience.</p>
</statement>
</activity>

